message: "If you use this software or build on it, please cite it as below."
title: "Теле-Лента (tele-lenta)"
abstract: >-
  A Telegram Mini App that turns classifieds, jobs, and event posts from many
  public Montenegrin and Serbian Telegram chats into one de-duplicated feed,
  keeping a link back to every source message.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-26
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ValDagon/tele-lenta"
url: "https://github.com/ValDagon/tele-lenta"
authors:
